commit 4b65e7ebf83d716924eec056930e3741715bf56c

C03: the Discord switcher steps down reading which row it has SELECTED (UI Automation SelectionItem) and presses Enter only when that row names the recipient: counting the rows the switcher added and clicking the matching row's rectangle both ended on the neighbour «Johana» while the matching row «Violeta, usuario, ron.91» was found (DISCORD1857 runs d and e, nothing sent, the title guard refused each time)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


